<!-- The ohnd complaint Word styles: the cross-engine recipe (tools/fb/src/docxxengine.rs; docs/EVAL-LOOP.md,
     "Cross-engine gate") in the face of the typst template ({font}, Times New Roman; L.R. 10.1 names no face) at
     12 pt (size 24 half points); Body Text in exact 27.6 pt line boxes (552 twips: typst pitch-body, L.R. 10.1
     double-spaced) with a half-inch first-line indent (typst para-indent); single lines in 13.8 pt boxes (276 twips:
     typst pitch-single); the headings at the type size on the body pitch with no space of their own. Letter page,
     1 in margins; the 1 1/2 in first-page top margin (L.R. 10.1) is the space before the court title. The footer's
     single-pitch line box ends 0.5 in above the page edge (footer="720"; typst footer-descent).
     docx/ohnd-complaint.lua writes every paragraph's own spacing, the footer (a centered page number, L.R. 10.1)
     and the last section. Twips: 20 x pt. -->
